      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Create a program to convert temperature in Fahrenheit to Celsius using the formula:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "celsius = (fahrenheit - 32) * (5/9)"
    },
    {
